<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MGM Grand said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MGM Grand said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns upgraded MGM Grand Inc to buy from attractive, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Rating action based on price, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/4 to 36-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
